// Description :
"P3406161637" "Track down the Lost leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P816259791" "You were unable to catch up with Lemkin, but found out where they will carry out the ritual!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2373742335" "Lemkin has grown overconfident. The ascension should have prevented this from happening, but it seems something went wrong. Does he truly believe his own thoughts to be above the masters we follow?<br><br>Already, he has infected the others with his way of thinking. We do not need to understand the 'why' of our rules, just that they are given to us and we must follow.<br><br>That these former brothers have a stronger conviction knowing the why of a foolhardy decision is... troubling, to say the least. I must apologize, {HeroName}. I have done my best to aid you, but every time, I have put you one step behind Lemkin. This will not happen again, I assure you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2505148925" "Lemkin and his Igneous allies are in the Hollows as we speak, performing the ceremony. Synapse is, unfortunately, not available to help. The PPD have informed me that he went straight to the Hollows to deal with the situation there, and has not been heard from since.<br><br>I can only assume that Synapse's powers have already been taken. My psychic abilities are showing an abnormal increase in Lemkin's powers, but not the others."
// AcceptString :
"P3139878016" "So only Lemkin has Synapse's powers."
// SendOffString :
"P1483999557" "Correct. If you can stop the ritual now before it is complete, we can prevent the rest of my brothers from being corrupted.<br><br><color orange>Be careful, {HeroName}. <color orange>Lemkin will have Synapse's powers. He may not have the ability to control them very well, but he will be a formidable opponent.</color><br><br>It is up to you now, {HeroName}, to prevent hundreds of Lost from gaining Synapse's powers through this vile magical ritual!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1738341424" "Stop the Lost from absorbing all of Synapse's powers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3633516741" "There's no time to lose, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2433470654" "Pools of lava fill the area of Grendel's Gulch. You can see the obelisk in the distance, sitting on one of the islands formed by the Igneous."
