"P129905614" "<t=5 d=5>Man, I do NOT want that to EVER happen again. Thanks a ton for the help, I owe you one! <t=5 d=5>I'll stick around here, help get this place back to a, uh, non lava engulfed state."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3783135034" "Lemkin"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2462894465" "Synapse's power is mine, I can feel it coursing through my body!<em>Our masters shall be pleased, more so than ever before!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2752454584" "A hero to practice my new abilities on. This shall be interesting!"

