// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2645178941" "<t=5 d=5>This is MY obelisk! All of you... all of you are FOOLS!<t=5 d=5>I will not allow my life's work to be used in such a base manner!<t=5 d=5>I will work with the idiotic Circle if I must, but I will be the one to seize the power, and use it with MY champion!<t=3 d=5>Echidna! Utter the words and obtain the power of Synapse!<t=8 d=5>WHAT?! Foolish girl! This hero has defeated the Lost for us, the Igneous for us, and you do THIS?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P378352275" "<t=6 d=6>ARGH! Useless, idiotic! But no matter, that was enough time for the power to build up! <t=6 d=6>Wait... no... this doesn't seem right... the obelisk, it's...!<Goto Spot2>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P772295998" "This isn't over. Mark my words, I will find the others! I know they are out there!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4019419470" "<shout>I do not need Synapse's powers to do this, I will kill this hero on my own, then take the powers!"
